    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE GAMES FOR KIDS:</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking for the ultimate children's game?</h2>Your child likes farms, animals and should have fun, laugh and learn important things at the same time?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/ada15648f5e8e5daef9d9b44a25a8c47.poster.avif?t=1713349029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/ada15648f5e8e5daef9d9b44a25a8c47.webm?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/ada15648f5e8e5daef9d9b44a25a8c47.mp4?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>LEARN:<br>* Logical thinking<br>* Hand-eye coordination<br>* Goal-oriented thinking<br>* How to use the computer mouse and PC<br>* Decision-making skills<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/595c1d089edaeef1c3bac623c9666324.poster.avif?t=1713349029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/595c1d089edaeef1c3bac623c9666324.webm?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/595c1d089edaeef1c3bac623c9666324.mp4?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Then our educational, high-quality farm animals game for children and toddlers is the perfect game. In the game, children can solve a variety of different jigsaw puzzles with fun hand-drawn animal and farm motifs. The difficulty is completely freely adjustable.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/c7b9d34d8dc00b1468b3ba4c2b6da07f.poster.avif?t=1713349029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/c7b9d34d8dc00b1468b3ba4c2b6da07f.webm?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/c7b9d34d8dc00b1468b3ba4c2b6da07f.mp4?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Important: The game contains no links or advertising and is completely child-safe!<br><br>Surprise your child today with our farm animals educational game.<br><br>Your McPeppergames team",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking for the ultimate children's game?</h2>Your child likes farms, animals and should have fun, laugh and learn important things at the same time?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/ada15648f5e8e5daef9d9b44a25a8c47.poster.avif?t=1713349029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/ada15648f5e8e5daef9d9b44a25a8c47.webm?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/ada15648f5e8e5daef9d9b44a25a8c47.mp4?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>LEARN:<br>* Logical thinking<br>* Hand-eye coordination<br>* Goal-oriented thinking<br>* How to use the computer mouse and PC<br>* Decision-making skills<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/595c1d089edaeef1c3bac623c9666324.poster.avif?t=1713349029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/595c1d089edaeef1c3bac623c9666324.webm?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909840/extras/595c1d089edaeef1c3bac623c9666324.mp4?t=1713349029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Then our educational, high-quality farm animals game for children and toddlers is the perfect game. In the game, children can solve a variety of different jigsaw puzzles with fun hand-drawn animal and farm motifs. The difficulty is completely freely adjustable.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.